      985        ShowZero AT ROW 10.5 COL 49.13
      986        RADIO-SET-1 AT ROW 11.5 COL 49.13 NO-LABEL
      987        t-in AT ROW 12.04 COL 2.75
      988        SortType AT ROW 14.75 COL 2.5 NO-LABEL
      989        Cli-art AT ROW 14.79 COL 49.13
      990        FILL-IN-1 AT ROW 13.67 COL 2.63 NO-LABEL
